# mesh of defect_matrix.py, ngl = 12). G(Delta) = g_Q(D1, D2)/zeta^2, R = G(Delta)/G(0).
# Resolved: box modes |kappa_j| <= kappa_max (kappa_j = 4 pi^2 j/Lam) on the window; cut off: |kappa| > kappa_max (weight of
